  <releases>
    <release version="1.5.0" date="2026-08-22">
      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>Added live server search, smart filtering (All / Favorites / Online / Offline), TCP/UDP protocol filter and star-marked favorite servers.</li>
          <li>Connect Fastest now walks the current sorted/filtered list and automatically tries the next server when a handshake times out or fails.</li>
          <li>Security hardening: removed OTP logging, added delete-all confirmation dialog, safe ZIP size limits and staging download.</li>
          <li>Updated application ID to match the repository (com.github.mahdi-arts.eovpn-pro).</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.5" date="2026-08-05">
      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>Added full Persian (Farsi) localization with RTL/LTR directional support and dynamic language switching.</li>
          <li>Redesigned network connection details panel using a beautiful fixed-size homogeneous layout.</li>
          <li>Optimized Backend settings tab with a native list design and added support for OpenVPN 3 Data Channel Offload (DCO).</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.4" date="2025-10-15">
      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>Pro edition branding and information updates.</li>
          <li>Added multi-threaded TCP Ping/Speed Test for OpenVPN configuration endpoints.</li>
          <li>Added speed-based list sorting and Select Fastest server automated utility.</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
  </releases>

